<p><iframe loading="lazy" style="border: 0;" src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3283.6806400166975!2d-3.1665783000000056!3d48.566086299999995!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x48118ccfffe526b1%3A0x1165334458be274d!2sStade+Municipal+de+Roudourou!5e1!3m2!1sfr!2sfr!4v1455892633666" width="690" height="450" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe></p>
